  "summary": "Implement streaming JSONL parsing in replay_analyzer.py to count malformed lines and aggregate per-session turn and invalid_output counts. The current stub returns empty results; replace it with logic that reads the file line by line, validates JSON, and updates session statistics accordingly.",
